    ``jnp.fft.rfft2`` computes the transform along the last two axes by default.

    >>> x = jnp.array([[[1, 3, 5],
    ...                 [2, 4, 6]],
    ...                [[7, 9, 11],
    ...                 [8, 10, 12]]])
    >>> with jnp.printoptions(precision=2, suppress=True):
    ...   jnp.fft.rfft2(x)
    Array([[[21.+0.j  , -6.+3.46j],
