    The size of the output along the axis ``axes[1]`` is ``(s[1]/2)+1``, if ``s[1]``
    is even and ``(s[1]+1)/2``, if ``s[1]`` is odd. The size of the output along
    the axis ``axes[0]`` is ``s[0]``.

